  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "A day metal detecting the wet and dry sand, with the <a href=\"@ctx3030/\" data-kind=\"internal\">CTX3030</a>, with the Anderson neptune and T-Rex Scoop, nothing really much on the wet sand today, but found a little low spot on the dry sand so just stayed in that area, walked it through until the GPS was blanked out thats the beauty of the <a href=\"@ctx3030/\" data-kind=\"internal\">CTX GPS</a> you can see where you have missed, area covered, plenty of coins to spend and some pre-decimal coins from the dry sand and a nice little signet ring. pretty tough finding targets but a lovely day out."
  },
